{
  "$comment": [
    "The cocktail list: house specs as the bar writes them, plus the classics any guest can",
    "order. `npm run seed:bar` loads this; re-running updates a recipe by name and replaces its",
    "measures, so this file is the master copy - edit here or on the Recipes screen.",
    "",
    "An ingredient is written the way a bartender says it. The seed links it to a stock line",
    "when the names match exactly, so \"Campari\" finds the bottle but \"Gin\" stays unlinked",
    "until someone picks the house pour. The Recipes screen lists what is still unlinked.",
    "",
    "  method    shake | dry_then_wet_shake | stir | build | roll | throw | blend | hot | none",
    "  unit      ml | dash | bar_spoon | each | slice | wedge | leaf | pinch | top_up | rinse"
  ],
